# Raw/bulky/possibly-sensitive run artifacts are never committed.
# The canonical raw workspace lives OUTSIDE the repo (~/kung-fu-pack-eval).
# Under the repo we keep only curated, sanitized result.json + metrics + report.
*.env
secrets*
**/agent.log
**/lane.log
**/*.raw.*
**/pack_snapshot/
report/figures/*.tmp
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# local demo scratch (the bad sample intentionally contains dash chars to test the detector)
tasks/fixtures/sample_packs/
**/gold.map.txt
